Package: cmice
Type: Package
Title: Constrained Multiple Imputation by Chained Equations
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-06-20
Authors@R: c(
    person("Phuong The", "Nguyen", email = "phuong.nguyen@r.hit-u.ac.jp",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5093-9767")))
Description: Implements Constrained MICE (CMICE), a generalisable modification
    to the Fully Conditional Specification (FCS) multiple imputation framework
    that enforces observation-specific structural constraints on the admissible
    category set during the multinomial sampling step. Designed for cancer
    registry histology imputation where nonspecific morphology codes restrict
    the admissible subtype set by diagnostic classification rules. Compatible
    with the standard mice() / with() / pool() pipeline. See Nguyen (2026)
    Statistics in Medicine (under review) for the methodological details.
